* **P99.9 Tail Latency Reduction**: Decreased P99.9 latency from $42,100$ ns down to $445$ ns (**$98.9\\%$ reduction in tail latency**).
* **L1 Data Cache Misses**: Reduced L1D cache miss rate from $14.30\\%$ to $0.95\\%$.
